WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.635 --> 00:00:15.219
Drina Meso d.o.o. reports a problem with a carton. Its number is scanned.

2
00:00:15.856 --> 00:00:25.155
Back, link by link: the slit reel, the laminate reel, the film and adhesive lots with the supplier's lot numbers.

3
00:00:25.788 --> 00:00:35.877
One of those film lots is scanned: everything made from it, forward.

4
00:00:36.506 --> 00:00:46.600
Every order and customer it reached. Food packaging law asks for one step back and one forward. Here every step is one scan.

5
00:00:48.068 --> 00:00:54.513
Mass balance, order by order: film in, product out, scrap, trim, solvent.

6
00:00:55.966 --> 00:01:03.147
What nobody wrote down stays visible: it is where to look first, never booked away.
